# CHIME CIRCUIT: the payload never turns on the ship that tows it. When it
# blows, the ships near it are thrown clear but its own ship is not; the
# three fires are left in a triangle whose point is away from its ship
# (here the ball hangs below it, so the point is below) and whose corners
# are clear of it either side; and its own fires spare it for their first
# second. Anyone else is hurt by them. A ship in a fire is slowed, not
# stopped: it flies on out with one hit.
seed 1
game chime
wait 30
cheat race 1
cheat park_cpus
cheat go
cheat idle 1
# player one hovers (two frames of thrust in five) with the payload in tow
cheat place 0 150 26
cheat vel 0 0 30
cheat power 0 5
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
hold A 2
wait 3
expect power0 == 5
expect x0 == 150
expect bally0 > 34
# ship two comes alongside just before it blows
cheat place 1 176 40
cheat revive 1
hold A 2
wait 3
expect power0 == 0
expect fires == 3
# the other ship is thrown clear; its own ship is left alone
expect stun1 > 0
expect vx1 > 800
expect stun0 == 0
expect vx0 == 0
expect hp0 == 3
# the point is below the ball, the corners either side of the ship
expect fire_x0 == 150
expect fire_y0 > 40
expect fire_x1 < 140
expect fire_x2 > 160
# its own fire spares it for a second ...
cheat place 0 136 30
cheat vel 0 0 0
cheat mercy 0 0
wait 2
expect hp0 == 3
# ... and then it doesn't
wait 60
cheat place 0 136 30
cheat vel 0 0 0
wait 2
expect hp0 == 2
# another ship is hurt by them at once
cheat place 1 163 29
cheat vel 1 0 0
cheat hp 1 3
cheat mercy 1 0
wait 1
expect hp1 == 2
# a fire slows a ship but can't hold it: out the other side with one hit
cheat clear
cheat fire 100 30
cheat place 0 100 30
cheat vel 0 0 0
cheat hp 0 3
cheat mercy 0 0
hold LEFT 24
expect x0 < 91
expect hp0 == 2
expect alive0 == 1
